        "shipping_returns_heading": "Delivery & returns",
        "shipping_returns_content": "<p><strong>Made only when you order.</strong> We don’t print in bulk or hold warehouse stock — every piece is printed after your order comes in, so nothing is overproduced and nothing goes to waste.</p><p>That’s why delivery takes a little longer than off-the-shelf retailers: please allow <strong>12–15 working days</strong> from order to your door. Every UK order ships <strong>free</strong>, fully tracked, rolled in a rigid tube so it arrives flat and unmarked.</p><p><strong>Changed your mind?</strong> Return any unused print in its original packaging within 30 days of delivery for a full refund — email <a href=\"mailto:support@posterandform.com\">support@posterandform.com</a> and we’ll sort it.</p>",
